<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεῖπον</span></b> , in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαεῖπον</span> (v. infr.),
		serving as aor. 2 to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαγορεύω</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tell fully</i> or <i>distinctly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμιγμένοι . . ἦ ἀπάνευθε; δίειπέ
					μοι, ὄφρα δαείω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.425
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπον πόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; <i>declare,</i> of an oracle, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OT</u>
				854
			</span></i>; <i>interpret</i> a riddle, ib.<i><span class="en">
				394
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				275a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>speak one with another, converse,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαειπέμεν ἀλλήλοισιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.215
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>fix upon, agree,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διειπάμενος ἐν ᾧ [χρόνῳ] ἀποδώσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1351b5
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EE</u>
				1243a31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				9.27
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
